      "defaultSalutation": "Dear Mr.",
      "subjectFormat": "{subject} - {letterNumber}",
      "bodyFormat": "Dear {salutation} {recipientName},\n\nKindly please find the attached file containing our formal Technical & Commercial Proposal regarding \"{subject}\" (Letter Reference: {letterNumber}).\n\nThis submission details our comprehensive scope of work, technical methodology, project schedule, and commercial breakdown. We remain confident that our proposal meets the highest engineering standards and delivers optimal value for your project.\n\nWe look forward to scheduling a clarification meeting at your earliest convenience to review the submission together.\n\nYours sincerely,\n{signatoryName}\n{signatoryPosition}\n{companyName}",
      "isSystem": true
    },
