      "bodyFormat": "Dear {salutation} {recipientName},\n\nKindly please find the attached file regarding \"{subject}\" (Letter Ref: {letterNumber}).\n\nIn order to adhere to the project timeline and milestone delivery dates, your expedited review and formal feedback / Code Approval (Code 1 / Code 2) is kindly requested by the required date.\n\nThank you for your prompt attention to this matter.\n\nYours sincerely,\n{signatoryName}\n{signatoryPosition}\n{companyName}",
